      <span class="tg-hero__type">Topical Study</span>
      <h1 class="tg-hero__title">Serving on a Jury as a Christian</h1>
      <p class="tg-hero__intro">
        A jury summons is not an interruption to the Christian life. It is a place to live it out —
        whether a believer may serve, what God's Word says about doing justice, and how to serve well.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="tg-hero__key-verse">
        <p>He has shown you, O man, what is good. And what does the LORD require of you but to act justly, to love mercy, and to walk humbly with your God?</p>
        <cite><a class="ref" data-ref="Micah 6:8">Micah 6:8</a> (BSB)</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
